# ==============================================================================
# Purpose: Declarative definition for the Google-managed `CLIENT_TO_AGENT`
#          Ingress Agent Gateway protecting both Cymbal Bank Reasoning Engines.
# Architecture/Context: Imported via `gcloud network-services agent-gateways import`
#          and paired with a `CONTENT_AUTHZ` Model Armor policy to block direct
#          prompt injections and jailbreaks before reaching Agent Runtime.
# Dependencies/Side Effects: Requires `networkservices.googleapis.com`.
# Author: Pradeep Singh
# License: Apache-2.0
# ==============================================================================
name: ${INGRESS_GATEWAY}
description: Cymbal Bank Client-to-Agent ingress gateway enforcing Model Armor prompt safety.
protocols:
  - MCP
googleManaged:
  governedAccessPath: CLIENT_TO_AGENT
labels:
  managed-by: cymbal-agw-demo
